{"id":"34230908","title":"从华农走出的“大地脊梁”！央视纪录片专题报道→","published_at":"2026-10-11T10:19:00+08:00","published_label":"2026-10-11","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCwibT51MYgiasQnlbb0e0jGmvevS0ka6CpLc594Rv1F7bobH2X0MlLicibWaBBQqTtcMKncMOqdvAw2cXTo0ok1UMXrJxvmP11aA0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"近日 中央广播电视总台农业农村频道 “三农群英汇”栏目 《大地脊梁》系列纪录片 播出中国工程院院士 华南农业大学教授罗锡文专题 真实饱满的情感、细节丰富的动作","tags":["人物"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-HjmhKdOHcEXs9COF5O2wA","paper_url":"https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34230908","word_count":1673,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T00:22:43+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=3182201652098646022&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcib9OUORJLexR67iaNiaHMVsUPWQ9iaHzdXxmktt72Ogu82fOicNHLPAaUSbpdSIaA09Yau3GoRsGdYZ6g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><p><span><span>近日</span></span></p><p><span><span>中央广播电视总台农业农村频道</span></span></p><p><span><span>“三农群英汇”栏目</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>《大地脊梁》系列纪录片</span></span></span></p><section><section><p><span>播出中国工程院院士</span></p><p><span>华南农业大学教授罗锡文专题</span></p><p><span>真实饱满的情感、细节丰富的动作</span></p><p><span>情真意切的语言</span></p><p><span>还有绿油油的稻田、忙碌作业的农机……</span></p><p><span>屏幕上，一个个镜头串联起</span></p></section></section><p><span><span>这位常年赤脚下田的院士</span></span></p><p><span><span>五十余载扎根田野</span></span></p><p><span><span>深耕农业机械化事业的初心与坚守</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>点击视频，感受“大地脊梁”</span></span><span><span>的精神力量</span></span></span></p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckA2ju5y5YzfpBYq7CUbliclLqcKqDGUSWvfPvy7yIkcdibqToRsm4QFHJfaxAVpWXjaTFkibhjoYbb7XWCvwwCcQEs6ibcdicXyt4ic4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDtRibRTbSRLiacG04Jf3icBkIak2qgoKLxic7DLk8aRUshYY1GQrKT5wHfFssY78Iw5bNSibhIAWrAbGpSs9U2chD0PyuYv6Eoibb7g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBxA8sibSw1rJib6icD8a6Jrf7qcWib5jiagRvMwQCkpJ1I197kTk2HO2JiaFCzwMH5aviaZqeb6SknB3AMRI5ktmib6mMRFKyqzIMG5eA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/IkqsxLQqENaJVfQWHztfeqTJv7PKmibXXBw5w3x8FfBcQ1cWpibvBLbxlTKhAqWCHMiaalfHgoth3wdunUbUD8cVLlrIrGnOXn7ic2tqb0RvhAY/640?from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\"/></span></p><p><span><span>《大地脊梁》是为大力弘扬科学家精神而推出的系列纪录片，聚焦我国一批深耕农业领域的院士专家，以珍贵影像、本人自述与亲历者访谈，记录农业科研工作者矢志攻关、报国为民的奋斗历程。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCu1j3lSpbx2eWp5BPutwYVicjy8JPBS8zI1SY2aVicQdWwNcpFMQzc6avWl5cYomicEvvibCvtexdqfDCic3nzV1C3ebDHC6TEKIxY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>  珍贵镜头，真实记录！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>罗锡文的农机人生</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckDfACb5hnic7nuKU9dNOC9JfDcnfbOoIpfvjx181moiaCMuia6khmqTfwLcrzYKrHFo6RibMme6XOuDJMol0XWOYQM93wnBiandnjeQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>罗锡文坚定选择农机厂</span></span></p><section><p><span>1945年，罗锡文生于湖南株洲的一个农村家庭，插秧、拔秧、打谷子，是他年少时最熟悉的农事。彼时的他，常常赤脚站在田埂上，望着泥泞的水田，心里悄悄埋下一个愿望：“什么时候，不用人插秧就好了。”</span></p><p><span>1970年，从华中工学院无线电专业毕业后，罗锡文分配至贵州铜仁县农机厂，1979年考入华南农业大学攻读硕士，正式踏上农业机械化系统研究之路。</span></p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckBoZbKBN7h1PUe1UcR2y3W2nYtwLh0zLdpVyNrTJXDWqyvzsjDM2VvfOgEjVE0gsBG4RGht0k7M00SvLY94U5sSyzwAnAlSjvQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span>讲解农机设计方案</span></p><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckDFkXt31jk5lU7Cj2SRBf6LbJN7euFLBUQOVqiaaSmyerhmGTOVWCWhnhlYBiaicgBtHlxF09NB1O7UGSdyNm7wkAjKbC1h9GWT08/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>智慧农机在田间运作</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckCWYVYJiaSYrvbuyIXb9sAg2ibnqxsdczacrRr2fHcGXeSWRYypEAnwce0icebRHghicvV6sibt5uBian8C9Gd9ON9U5fzuWeLfYrNicY/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span>无人驾驶插秧机实现精准作业</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>深耕农业机械化研究数十载，罗锡文始终将农民从繁重的劳作中解放出来作为科研初心。</span></p><p><span>目睹传统水稻插秧的辛苦，他带领团队另辟蹊径，攻关水稻精量穴直播技术，创新研发了“三同步”水稻精量穴直播机具，省去了繁琐的育秧移栽环节，可节水30%、节肥15%以上，成果斩获2017年度国家技术发明奖二等奖，技术和机具推广至全国二十多个省区，还走出国门服务海外水稻种植。</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckAVfdN7rEgk5B4xbqPYqzaht5rWlUWddMv6PItvPNwv4kBdvbnJUN84iaXeoyeZKXMQ1vzAMp5kZmX14vwu0quyGpNpGhPH82qk/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span>河源市万绿智慧农场负责人</span><span>介绍无人农机提升农场产量情况</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>面对“未来谁来种地”的时代命题，罗锡文将目光转向智慧农机。2004年起，他带领团队在国内率先开展基于卫星定位的农业机械导航及自动作业技术研究，突破了精准定位、导航控制、系统集成等10项关键技术，打破了国外技术垄断。</span></p><p><span>2020年，</span><span>罗锡文</span><span>牵头建成全球首个水稻无人农场，实现了耕、种、管、收全程无人化作业。无人农场技术有效降低了生产成本，实现了稳产增产，如今已经在全国18个省份落地40余个智慧农场，覆盖水稻、玉米、小麦、油菜和花生等多种作物。</span></p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckBTyLiaVTMNsg3N4KwuW9W4mGtVBTVN6Yt0cyxQMBiaIpDDUKVrqNqtibDGic8LEgcOC7YRicUYfsXcianNuCs4T2jVpRuw0gfIibeeK8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>指导农民使用农机</span></span></p><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckATmaBFsdqgLw5Auu3TvDIOiaQEF8zLIXGOUCpe4clbcFaKXwUECWukWHbYZJxVaK6DfNuicgZltvUdjMmHvOLxciaz4pnyAAriaHE/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><span>赤脚下田观察</span></span></p><section><p><span>科研之外，罗锡文坚持将科研成果服务农民。他常说：</span><span>“只有自己踩在泥巴里面，才能知道泥的深浅和松软程度，才能判断机器作业好不好。”</span></p><p><span>为了实地检验农机作业效果，罗锡文一年超三分之一时间奔走在各地试验基地，</span><span>挽起裤腿赤脚踏入田中，</span><span>手把手向农户和农机手传授设备操作要点，希望智能农机可以让普通农民看得懂、学得会、用得顺。</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckBxo2EFHOll4pKvJBPrSiajgUSLwibRtRA04ibmgbGgmNf6jEjcfZsaxics7KJbia0nt1Rnjwz2yNnlaE1jCGKOPgibgLfN9gyAhiaEfQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckA6aG3iaawjJj3GnA2xW0kNebGDe5ya8JF3icZhzYygBhQ7MzViaRB4j8rbHW1mIhj70CPoQyvUDyh3qeB0MrXNB8Pl5JYkINGmCE/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>为学生授课</span></span></section><section><section><p><span>罗锡文坚持教书育人，培养了一大批农业工程领域青年人才。他始终关注着年轻学子的成长，2024年华农首期“农耕文明大讲堂”上，已经79岁的他带着同学们走进试验田，现场讲解智慧农机并邀请同学们上机体验，通过亲身感受勉励大家成为知农爱农创新型人才，将农耕文明融入思政课堂。同年，以学校庆祝办学115周年为契机，他又牵头捐资设立“强农”教育基金，激励青年学子投身“三农”事业，现场发言感动全场。</span></p><p><span>如今，他依旧步履不停，持续针对丘陵缓坡地水稻种植开展技术试验，不断拓展我国农业机械化的应用边界。</span></p><p><span>每当别人问起他数十载研究奔走的感受，他总是这样答道：“如果有下辈子，我还会选择干农机！”</span></p></section><p><span>脚踏泥土，心向良田</span></p><p><span>罗锡文院士用五十余载的坚守</span></p><p><span>把论文写在祖国广袤大地上</span></p><p><span>榜样的力量催人奋进</span></p><p><span>华农师生也将传承这份爱农事农的情怀</span></p><p><span>以科技为犁</span></p><p><span>勇担强农兴农时代使命</span></p><p><span>在推进农业现代化的道路上</span></p><p><span>奋勇前行</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652891076&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7c6cad50de967896e4109eda56784b8d&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckASibLdzy6BzFvWgicybOgqQr3zBByMTDteicr2OGmO3FM3REKoEcseM2r7AN1icpD1K0WlMTgpGpQA8Lc1AdEjbFzbxKwicXQvMO20/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span><span>华农第二位！罗锡文院士荣获全国优秀共产党员！</span></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652801381&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=34e91c3669912971ff59edd2a3773be6&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckD79E9sbmGjx2GfXtDjiazgmLJuUgRkia6KXcybvAlas9UwNeJibLpMKGMvGLu9BZR2kMpqSa9icmPgLxK3yv6